            "text": "theorem derivative_bound_rising {h z : ℝ} (hh : 0 < h) (hz : 0 ≤ z) (n : ℕ) :\n    |iteratedDerivWithin n (profile (1 + h)) (Ici 0) z| ≤\n      rising h n * rising (1 + h) n"
